# Queue / SQLite rules

- Database at `<root>\database\frameforge.db` (under the configured download root; default `K:\JEREMY'S FILES\downloads\database\frameforge.db` on Windows) with `PRAGMA journal_mode=WAL`.
- Jobs table tracks: id, url, title, status, priority, progress, error, paths, format_preference, upscale, timestamps, options_json.
- Statuses: pending, downloading, download_completed, upscaling, completed, failed, cancelled.
- Single worker claims next highest-priority pending job atomically.
- Never allow two rows in `downloading` simultaneously.
- On startup: reset interrupted downloading/upscaling → pending for retry.
